WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,220 --> 00:00:07,220
The middle is exposed, grapes are planted on both sides, fruit trees are planted on the outside, and vegetables are planted on the outermost periphery. Three hundred bottles cannot be wasted.

2
00:00:07,220 --> 00:00:10,609
No

3
00:00:10,609 --> 00:00:25,858
Working for a year takes too much mental energy

4
00:00:25,858 --> 00:00:34,330
You can only take your time

5
00:00:34,330 --> 00:00:35,330
He grew up like this overnight

6
00:00:35,330 --> 00:00:40,960
It's only been one night outside, but the plants in the space have been growing for at least ninety days

7
00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:45,960
In other words, as long as there are seeds and water, I will not be short of fresh vegetables and fruits in the future.

8
00:00:45,960 --> 00:00:52,080
Meat cannot be raised, but I have stocked up tens of thousands of kilograms. It will be enough for us, mother and son, until we grow old.
